New algorithm: Assign priority inversely proportional to remaining capacity after adding the item, preferring bins where the item fits perfectly or leaves minimal slack, while penalizing overflows heavily.
}

function:
def priority(item: float, bins: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
    mask = bins >= item
    prio = np.full_like(bins, -np.inf)
    if np.any(mask):
        prio[mask] = np.floor((bins[mask] - item) / item)
    return prio
